  "summary": "<p>Marco Rubio, Secretary of State</p>\n\n<section class=\"wp-block-default-hero-container wp-block-default-hero-container--no-featured-content \">\n\n\t<div class=\"wp-block-default-hero module featured-content page-header \">\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"row bc_row\">\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"row\" dir=\"ltr\">\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"featured-content__copy\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"featured-content__headline stars-above\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tMaldives Independence Day\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</h1>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"article-meta\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- get document type -->\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta doctype-meta\">Press Statement</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta__audience\"></p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta__location\"></p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<p class=\"article-meta__publish-date\">July 25, 2026</p>\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"page-header__actions\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"classic-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"wp-block-classic\">\n<p>On behalf of the United States of America, I congratulate the people of the Maldives as they celebrate their Independence Day.</p>\n<p>This year marks 60 years of diplomatic relations between the United States and the Maldives, and we look forward to growing our partnership on key issues related to maritime security and preserving a stable Indian Ocean region.</p>\n<p>The United States sends our best wishes to the Maldivian people.</p>\n<p><input type=\"hidden\" data-filter=\"111001000111\" /></p>\n</div></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:70px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>",
